# Source footage and stills live on disk only — ~1 GB of camera material that
# has no business in git. The animation reads them by path; it never needs them
# committed. Keep them backed up separately.
/*.mp4
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.png

# Video editor scratch
widevideo/cache/

# Render intermediates: 300 PNGs per pass, regenerated by `npm run render`
animation/intro/frames/

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
